<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Brian McGuigan half-yr net rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Brian McGuigan half-yr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  1.63 vs   1.23</p>
<p>    Net profit			  1.06 vs   0.82</p>
<p>    Sales				 8.60 vs 7.13</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   2.0 vs 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Brian McGuigan Wines Ltd is a winemaker.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
